<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Coroner — forensics for Symfony Messenger</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0d1117; --panel: #161b22; --border: #30363d;
            --text: #c9d1d9; --muted: #8b949e;
            --green: #3fb950; --red: #f85149; --amber: #d29922; --blue: #58a6ff;
        }
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
            font: 14px/1.5 ui-monospace, 'Cascadia Code', Consolas, monospace;
            padding: 32px 24px 64px;
        }
        header { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        h1 { font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        h1 span { color: var(--red); }
        .tagline { color: var(--muted); }
        .connect { margin: 10px 0 28px; color: var(--muted); }
        .connect code { color: var(--blue); }
        section { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        h2 { font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 14px; }
        h2 .count { color: var(--text); }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        th { text-align: left; color: var(--muted); font-weight: normal; padding: 6px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 12px; }
        td { padding: 7px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d; vertical-align: top; }
        tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
        .pill { display: inline-block; padding: 1px 9px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 12px; }
        .pill.shipped { color: var(--green); background: rgba(63,185,80,.12); }
        .pill.confirmed { color: var(--green); background: rgba(63,185,80,.12); }
        .pill.received { color: var(--amber); background: rgba(210,153,34,.12); }
        .pill.graveyard { color: var(--red); background: rgba(248,81,73,.12); }
        .id { color: var(--blue); }
        .error { color: var(--red); }
        .muted { color: var(--muted); }
        .payload { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-all; }
        .empty { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; padding: 12px 10px; }
        footer { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 8px; }
        a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>☠ CORONER <span>//</span> morgue</h1>
        <span class="tagline">forensics for Symfony Messenger failed messages</span>
    </header>
    <p class="connect">
        MCP server: <code>php bin/console mcp:server coroner</code> (stdio) · <code>POST /mcp/coroner</code> (http) ·
        agent: <code>php bin/console coroner:chat</code> — read the graveyard with <code>list_failed_messages</code>,
        open bodies with <code>inspect_failed_message</code>, get verdicts from <code>analyze_failed_message</code>.
    </p>

    <section>
        <h2>THE GRAVEYARD <span class="count">— {{ failed|length }} failed message{{ failed|length == 1 ? '' : 's' }} in the failure transport</span></h2>
        {% if failed is empty %}
            <p class="empty">Empty. Nobody died today. Run <code>php bin/console coroner:demo:break</code> to break something.</p>
        {% else %}
            <table>
                <tr><th>id</th><th>message</th><th>payload</th><th>cause of death</th><th>retries</th></tr>
                {% for f in failed %}
                    <tr>
                        <td class="id">#{{ f.id }}</td>
                        <td>{{ f.class|split('\\')|last }}</td>
                        <td class="payload">{{ f.payload }}</td>
                        <td class="error">{{ f.error }} <span class="muted">({{ f.exception_class }})</span></td>
                        <td>{{ f.retries }}</td>
                    </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </table>
        {% endif %}
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>ORDERS <span class="count">— {{ orders|length }} in the morgue register</span></h2>
        <table>
            <tr><th>id</th><th>sku</th><th>qty</th><th>customer</th><th>status</th></tr>
            {% for order in orders %}
                <tr>
                    <td class="id">#{{ order.id }}</td>
                    <td>{{ order.sku }}</td>
                    <td>{{ order.quantity }}</td>
                    <td class="muted">{{ order.customerEmail }}</td>
                    <td><span class="pill {{ order.status }}">{{ order.status }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </table>
    </section>

    <footer>
        Coroner · Symfony AI 1.0.0-BETA1 + official PHP MCP SDK (mcp/sdk) · destructive tools always elicit the human —
        <a href="https://github.com/EAnge1o/coroner">source on GitHub</a>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
